    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/0a2a0181289c6f1547455972b4eb7256.poster.avif?t=1723767611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/0a2a0181289c6f1547455972b4eb7256.webm?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/0a2a0181289c6f1547455972b4eb7256.mp4?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>~50 Colorful Levels With Progressive Difficulty<br>~Every time you restart the colors of the level will change.<br>~Tight controls with good response<br>~Easy to learn and hard to master wall jump mechanic.<br>~A challenging game that will require a lot of skill and timing from the player.<br>~A relaxing music with some nice beats for your gameplay.<br>~ help, they are getting closer~<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/2cbf96c4e4da10e870c6709093287f07.poster.avif?t=1723767611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/2cbf96c4e4da10e870c6709093287f07.webm?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/2cbf96c4e4da10e870c6709093287f07.mp4?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/0a2a0181289c6f1547455972b4eb7256.poster.avif?t=1723767611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/0a2a0181289c6f1547455972b4eb7256.webm?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/0a2a0181289c6f1547455972b4eb7256.mp4?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>~50 Colorful Levels With Progressive Difficulty<br>~Every time you restart the colors of the level will change.<br>~Tight controls with good response<br>~Easy to learn and hard to master wall jump mechanic.<br>~A challenging game that will require a lot of skill and timing from the player.<br>~A relaxing music with some nice beats for your gameplay.<br>~ help, they are getting closer~<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/2cbf96c4e4da10e870c6709093287f07.poster.avif?t=1723767611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/2cbf96c4e4da10e870c6709093287f07.webm?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459570/extras/2cbf96c4e4da10e870c6709093287f07.mp4?t=1723767611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
